From ud718c6bb1db28db2 at groups.google.com  Fri Dec  7 16:25:19 2007
From: ud718c6bb1db28db2 at groups.google.com (Steve Buckland)
Date: Fri, 07 Dec 2007 16:25:19 +0000
Subject: Re: repeated sampling in a season
Message-ID: <Y4kpv8NkBI4.72hz1vDc3zYJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Y4kpv8NkBI4.1OPiS-_ZA-4J@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
References: <Y4kpv8NkBI4.1OPiS-_ZA-4J@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
